  "description": "LAJQOD crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C48 H120 B16 Cl2 O5 Si8 Tb4. From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 2 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 2 O neighbors; Tb1F (Tb) has 2 O neighbors; Tb2F (Tb) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.704-3.884 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 106.89-115.26°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C48H120B16Cl2Tb4O5Si8.",
